+# Prompt25 proof matrix
+
+| Gate | Evidence/control | Disposition |
+|---|---|---|
+| Absent actual session ledger | Pre-task real session accessor assertion | Red exit1 preserved |
+| Native creation plus2 consecutive transitions | Genuine seeded Random; independent pushMessage/consumeChunk strings; actual settled raw and prefixes | Both owners, sequences0/1/2, local counters restart |
+| Owner/session isolation | Identical labels, seed and observation IDs; foreign owner/session handles and copied JSON/reference tokens | Reject without changing real history |
+| Exact joins | Equal-length foreign prefix, wrong perspective/cursor, foreign held parent and restore proof | Prepare rejects; owner1 tentative state never commits |
+| Positional selection | Equal literal repetitions, then different trailing request with earlier matching raw | Select latest equal occurrence; trailing mismatch rejects |
+| Restore | Actual reset result captured before actions; same held parent; literal receipt prefix | Existing reference retained; no fresh sequence |
+| Wait/force/revival | Mirrored actual production sessions and legal selection continuations | Nonactor and actor deliveries committed |
+| Suppression | Actual OU team preview auto-default; actual partial-choice consumed restore; terminal | Intermediates unbound; null current never resurrects |
+| Rollback | Real candidate diagnostic rejection, owner2 trace failure, owner2 raw join failure after owner1 tentative, invalid owner2 bundle fault | Both committed histories unchanged; next valid transition works |
+| Bundle prerequisite | Test-only construction fault, stack includes unchanged validatePipelineEpisodeRecordBundle | Rejected before ledger commit |
+| Lifecycle | Failed generation, stale preparation/handles, post-commit retirement failure, synchronous close revoke | No escaped new authority |
+| Legacy compatibility | Accepted original seam false activation / unstarted restore | Ordinary session works, no ledger authority |
+| Wire | Fixed-clock pre-task v1/v2 initial result/boundary/snapshot/transition/bundles | Compare exact bytes and IDs |
+| Prior behavior | Trace/provider/env/session/settling/source/restore/cleanup/HTML/characterization batch | Fresh commands/logs |
+| Broader requirements | Separate original TS and Python requirement modes | Preserve1 TS +2 Python failures |
+
+Equal-native continuation, unchanged-restore reference retention and terminal/consumed continuation helper tests use explicitly labeled test-only boundary models with actual native environments and held traces. They are not adopted validators or claimed new session transition APIs. Genuine Random and mirrored force/revival cases use actual session transitions. Test taps are independent diagnostic oracles, never certificates. No arbitrary same-byte injected-stream detector is claimed.
